In OptimismPortal2.sol:384-391, there's a branch that handles both super game types (using rootClaimByChainId) and legacy game types (using rootClaim directly):                                

  ```
if (_isSuperGameType(disputeGameProxy.gameType())) {            
      outputRootClaim = disputeGameProxy.rootClaimByChainId(systemConfig.l2ChainId());
  } else {
      outputRootClaim = disputeGameProxy.rootClaim();
  }

```

  Once all chains have migrated to super root dispute games, the legacy rootClaim() path should be removed, leaving rootClaimByChainId as the only code path.

## What

Remove the legacy game type branch in OptimismPortal2.proveWithdrawalTransaction once super root games are the only supported option.

